    sa: ["What does Scripture teach about God and government?", ["sovereign", "purpose", "accountable", "justice", "order", "humble"], "A good answer says God rules over rulers, instituted government to restrain evil and promote justice and order, and holds all authorities accountable, so believers respond with humility, prayer and hope."],
